os0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"closed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2019-11-14T12:47:21Z","state_reason":null,"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goreleaser/goreleaser/issues/comments/553878184","html_url":"https://github.com/goreleaser/goreleaser/issues/1221#issuecomment-553878184","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goreleaser/goreleaser/issues/1221","id":553878184,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU1Mzg3ODE4NA==","user":{"login":"qmuntal","id":3747816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NDc4MTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3747816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal","html_url":"https://github.com/qmuntal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2019-11-14T13:02:39Z","updated_at":"2019-11-14T13:08:25Z","body":"I understand that this can add complexity to the code base and that would require effort to maintain, but a `dll` file is also a binary, so you are not breaking the foundation goals. \r\n\r\nIn fact, goreleaser can be used to build shared libraries, the only problem is that the binary file name is wrong.\r\n\r\nWould you at least consider fixing this issue if I create a PR with a possible solution?\r\n\r\nThanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goreleaser/goreleaser/issues/comments/553878184/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"qmuntal","id":3747816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NDc4MTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3747816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal","html_url":"https://github.com/qmuntal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goreleaser/goreleaser/issues/comments/553879344","html_url":"https://github.com/goreleaser/goreleaser/issues/1221#issuecomment-553879344","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goreleaser/goreleaser/issues/1221","id":553879344,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU1Mzg3OTM0NA==","user":{"login":"caarlos0","id":245435,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NTQzNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245435?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0","html_url":"https://github.com/caarlos0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-11-14T13:06:01Z","updated_at":"2019-11-14T13:06:01Z","body":"> I understand that this can add complexity to the code base and that would require effort to maintain, but a `dll` file is also a binary, so you are not breaking the foundation goals. In fact, goreleaser can be used to build shared libraries, the only problem is that the binary file name is wrong.\r\n\r\nyeah, you're right about that.\r\n\r\n\r\nmaybe if we add a custom `extension` config field (which defaults to exe on windows)?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goreleaser/goreleaser/issues/comments/553879344/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"caarlos0","id":245435,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NTQzNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245435?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0","html_url":"https://github.com/caarlos0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caarlos0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goreleaser/goreleaser/issues/comments/553898435","html_url":"https://github.com/goreleaser/goreleaser/issues/1221#issuecomment-553898435","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goreleaser/goreleaser/issues/1221","id":553898435,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU1Mzg5ODQzNQ==","user":{"login":"qmuntal","id":3747816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NDc4MTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3747816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal","html_url":"https://github.com/qmuntal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2019-11-14T13:56:01Z","updated_at":"2019-11-14T13:56:01Z","body":"Great! The custom `extension` is a good solution but tricky to define, as the file extension depends on the `goos` + `goarch` combination, and I can't think on an easy way to represent this in yaml (I'm not an expert neither).\r\n\r\nWhat's clear is that the [current defaults](https://github.com/goreleaser/goreleaser/blob/master/internal/pipe/build/build.go#L130) must be maintained, which are:\r\n* goos: `windows` -> `.exe`\r\n* goos: `js`, goarch: `wasm `-> `.wasm`\r\n\r\nAnother approach could be to extend the list of hard-coded extensions to take into account the `buildmode` in windows:\r\n```go\r\nfunc extFor(target string, flags string) string {\r\n  if strings.Contains(target, \"windows\") {\r\n    if strings.Contains(flags, \"-buildmode=c-shared\") {\r\n      return \".dll\"\r\n    } else if strings.Contains(flags, \"-buildmode=c-archive\") {\r\n      return \".lib\"\r\n    }\r\n    return \".exe\"\r\n  }\r\n  if target == \"js_wasm\" {\r\n    return \".wasm\"\r\n  }\r\n  return \"\"\r\n}\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goreleaser/goreleaser/issues/comments/553898435/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"qmuntal","id":3747816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NDc4MTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3747816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal","html_url":"https://github.com/qmuntal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmuntal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users